<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n62437" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπαδν-ον</span></b> , τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>broad leather strap</i> fastening
			the yoke (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ζυγόν</span>) to the neck, and joined
			to the girth (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μασχαλιστήρ</span>), mostly in
			pl., <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				5.730
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.393
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				191
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Eq.</u>
				768
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PFay.</u>
				348
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii/iii A.D.)</span>: sg., <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				4.3
			</span></i> b <i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>): so metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνάγκας ἔδυ λέπαδνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ag.</u>
					218
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.):—later <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπαμνον</span></b>  acc. to <i><span class="en">
				Apollon.
				<u>Lex.</u>
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπαδνα</span>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέπαδνα σιδηρᾶ</span> iron <i>baskets,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				1821.112
			</span></i>.</div>
